{%- comment -%}
  Type Constants

  Single source for the viewport anchors used by every fluid size in the theme.
  Change a value here and every clamp() in the theme re-derives from it.

  Parameters:
  - key {String} Required. 'min_viewport' | 'max_viewport'.

  Usage:
    {%- capture min_vw -%}{%- render 'type-constants', key: 'min_viewport' -%}{%- endcapture -%}

  Only snippets/fluid-clamp.liquid should need these directly; callers pass a
  min/max pair and let that snippet do the interpolation.

  Schema: none.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case key -%}
  {%- when 'max_viewport' -%}1440
  {%- else -%}375
{%- endcase -%}
